        "created_at": "2014-11-14T19:05:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We did a similar thing with Scholar-Tempest-Nightmist-Fixer. &nbsp;Nightmist had enough draw to keep playing Mistbound, and Tempest+Scholar were cycling Reclaim-&gt;DDA to put mistbound and grease gun into play every round. &nbsp;It was vs. Akash'bhuta, and we called the game after 2 rounds because we were doing very little damage but had Akash completely locked down. &nbsp;The environment had no destruction and not enough damage to overcome our healing.</p>",
